      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 11  
      **Languages** Common  
      **Challenge** 3 (700 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The manticore makes three attacks, using Rend or Tail Spike in any combination.

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+3,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage.

      ***Tail Spike.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Tail Spike]), range 100/200 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+3,dicelabel=Damage [Tail Spike]) Piercing damage.

    type: custom
